# integrations/mcp/local/solus/env.allow — variable NAMES the companion may
# pass through from the host to bin/launch (solus_companion.config
# ENV_ALLOW_FILE). One name per line. A strict SUBSET of the launcher's own
# env -i allowlist (solus/env_allowlist.py): PATH is a launcher constant and
# SOLUS_MCP_WORKSPACE is companion-SET, so neither is inherited.
HOME
USER
LANG
LC_ALL
TMPDIR
